name = openevv
summary = "Eloquence (openevv)"
description = """OpenEVV driver for 64-bit NVDA with separate language and voice selection, Classic 11 kHz default, pronunciation tools and Unicode corrections. A compatible, separately supplied OpenEVV engine is required at build time."""
